  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Light, delicate, and golden, lady fingers add effortless elegance to any dessert. These airy sponge cookies snap outside with a tender crumb inside, perfect for tiramisu, trifles, or coffee dunking. Quick to make with pantry staples, homemade lady fingers taste fresher and hold their shape beautifully.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-lady-fingers\">Why You’ll Love This lady fingers</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-lady-fingers\">How to Make Lady Fingers</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-lady-fingers\">Pro Tips for Making lady fingers</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-lady-fingers\">How to Serve this lady fingers</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-lady-fingers\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This lady fingers</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Perfectly light and airy texture that melts in your mouth.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Versatile treat for desserts or as a delightful snack.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Simple ingredients make it easy to whip up at home.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Great for pairing with coffee, tea, or your favorite dessert.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-7332\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"7332\" data-servings=\"0\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><div class=\"wprm-layout-container wprm-padding-40 meadow-header\">\n  <div class=\"wprm-layout-column-container wprm-column-gap-20 wprm-column-rows-recipe-600 wprm-column-rows-reverse wprm-row-gap-20 meadow-header-columns\">\n    <div class=\"wprm-layout-column w